        "33 labor-market measures including the unemployment rate, labor force participation rate and employment-population ratio",
        "21 breakdowns and 188 groups, including age, activity, class of worker, disability status, duration of unemployment, education",
        "Monthly data from January 1948 to the latest BLS release",
        "Seasonal adjustment shown per series, with a twelve-month moving average drawn over not-seasonally-adjusted data",
        "The underlying BLS series ID displayed under every chart"
